WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.231
Module twelve:

2
00:00:01.231 --> 00:00:04.252
algorithmic trading and artificial intelligence.

3
00:00:04.252 --> 00:00:08.406
What a bot does and does not do, why latency and execution matter,

4
00:00:08.406 --> 00:00:13.190
what machine learning finds in prices, and where language models are useful.

5
00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:17.291
A bot executes a rule without emotions or fatigue:

6
00:00:17.291 --> 00:00:22.314
it is not afraid to sell after a fall and does not forget to set a stop at night.

7
00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:24.857
But it does not make the rule profitable.

8
00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:29.074
The rule is one link out of five, and most trouble is in the others:

9
00:00:29.074 --> 00:00:31.803
the data arrived late, the exchange refused,

10
00:00:31.803 --> 00:00:35.214
an order filled partly or was repeated after a failure.
